      <h2>About QuickNotes</h2>
      <p>QuickNotes is a minimalist, lightning-fast application designed to capture your ideas instantly. It provides a distraction-free environment so you can organize your thoughts before they slip away.</p>

      <section>
        <h3>How to use QuickNotes</h3>
        <ol class="feature" id="feature">
          <li>Type your idea into the "New note" input box.</li>
          <li>Click the "Add Note" button or press Enter.</li>
          <li>View your saved ideas in the "Your notes" list below.</li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h3>Features</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Minimalist, distraction-free interface</li>
          <li>Instant note creation</li>
          <li>Secure local storage for your ideas</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h3>Keyboard shortcuts</h3>
        <table border="1" class="table" id="table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Shortcut</th>
              <th>Action</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>Ctrl + N</td>
              <td>Create a new note</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Enter</td>
              <td>Submit note</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Del</td>
              <td>Delete selected note</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </section>

